-- Exact mutual information Renyi-2 ratio for a joint distribution P_XY with marginals P_X, P_Y:
--   R_MI = P_2(XY) / (P_2(X) * P_2(Y)) in BQ.
-- Independent observers have R_MI = 1 (0 bits mutual info); perfectly correlated observers on N states have R_MI = N!
qi-bq-div : BQ → BQ → BQ
qi-bq-div a b = bq-make (bit-eq (fst a) (fst b)) (bin-mul (fst (snd a)) (snd (snd b))) (bin-mul (snd (snd a)) (fst (snd b)))
